*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
